    description: "WHAT, after PR #2200:\n- A Handlebars block name with a hyphen or a dot is cut at it (`each-in` -> `each`): 43 symbols on vault `ui`. Fixing it renames symbols and MOVES IDS; owner's call.\n- A dynamic partial is named `(lookup`; Glimmer `<Foo>` component tags are not tracked.\n- Blade: `@if` / `@foreach` / `@slot` / `@push` open no scope (a scheme decision, not part of WI-pihor); `<x-component>` tags are not tracked; `@include` emits no edge; directive names are matched case-sensitively.\n- Twig: the v15 change (`function_call` -> `call_site`) was measured on a fixture only, and the stable-id floor gate's Twig fixture has no `{{ func() }}`. `include('x.twig')` ends its edge on `twig:<unknown>:0-0:template:external_symbol`, an id_format violation (the `<unknown>` path slot).\n\nFound during PR 2 of the stable-id plan (the v15 bump), 2026-11-16 (PR #2200). Detail: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/stable_id_items_review_11152026/pr2/STATUS.md."  # ed5d
